Notebook[{
Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"(*", 
  RowBox[{
  "Make", " ", "the", " ", "whole", " ", "script", " ", "depend", " ", "on", " ",
    "the", " ", "increase", " ", "in", " ", 
   RowBox[{"performance", " ", "@", " ", "75"}], "%", " ", "correct"}], 
  "*)"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982116156401935*^9, 3.982116183348138*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[259]:=",ExpressionUUID->"9bfda760-ee03-47d6-a585-48ce09298d10"],

Cell["\<\
Criterion as discussed in our Zoom call (04.03.2026) was that at 75% correct \
we require an increase of 2% in prediction performance to be a \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]meaningful\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] effect size, i.e. \
an increase in predictability we argue is worth increasing the dimensionality \
for.

Three possible approaches:
1. SDT
Assume an unbiased YesNo observer with n = N(0,1) and s = N(d\
\[CloseCurlyQuote], 1); optimal performance with equally likely signal and \
noise trials for criterion lambda = 0.5*d\[CloseCurlyQuote]. Calculate the \
increase in d\[CloseCurlyQuote] necessary to achieve a certain performance \
gain at a reference performance, i.e. 2% at 75%.

2. LogOdds
In terms of LogOdds: For a given performance p we have the LogOdds = \
log(p/(1-p)).  this means we require a \[CapitalDelta] such that \
Log[0.75/0.25]+ \[CapitalDelta] = Log[0.77/0.23]. 

3. We argue that we want to know a constant fraction of what is \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]remaining\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]: If a decision-maker \
is at performance p, there is 1-p left to improve. We want a constant \
fraction of this before we say we found a meaningful effect size, e.g. 5 or \
10% of 1-p.
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982115116426798*^9, 3.982115278894409*^9}, {
  3.982133357646852*^9, 3.982133519853662*^9}, {3.9821468260772943`*^9, 
  3.982146951075204*^9}, {3.982148311075157*^9, 
  3.982148311075385*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9d1eaac4-ba7e-4230-9a75-\
85606a7ad00a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "Choose", " ", "starting", " ", "point", " ", "in", " ", "terms", " ", 
    "of", " ", "p", " ", "and", " ", "the", " ", "delta", " ", "in", " ", 
    "improvement"}], "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"myP", " ", "=", " ", "0.75"}], ";", " ", 
   RowBox[{"myDelta", " ", "=", " ", "0.02"}], ";"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982146961885605*^9, 3.982146985946492*^9}, {
  3.9821473137616987`*^9, 3.982147314124091*^9}, {3.982147978403564*^9, 
  3.982147980105967*^9}, {3.9821982616553392`*^9, 3.982198262235063*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[260]:=",ExpressionUUID->"652437d9-60ac-4630-bb4f-0042c97a73ad"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "Translate", " ", "the", " ", "above", " ", "condition", " ", "into", " ", 
    "a", " ", "dPrimeOffset"}], " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"dPrime", "=", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"InverseCDF", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"NormalDistribution", "[", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", "1"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "myP"}], "]"}], "-", 
      RowBox[{"InverseCDF", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"NormalDistribution", "[", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", "1"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"1", "-", "myP"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"dPrimeD", "=", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"InverseCDF", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"NormalDistribution", "[", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", "1"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"myP", "+", "myDelta"}]}], "]"}], "-", 
      RowBox[{"InverseCDF", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"NormalDistribution", "[", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", "1"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"1", "-", "myP", "-", "myDelta"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"dPrimeOffset", " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{
    "dPrimeD", " ", "-", " ", "dPrime", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]"}]}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982147003986878*^9, 3.9821470539387493`*^9}, {
  3.9821473120649776`*^9, 3.982147318512151*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[261]:=",ExpressionUUID->"2146dbd0-923c-4102-bc61-c31ce880b8c8"],

Cell[BoxData["0.12871419797826378`"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982147029072418*^9, 3.9821470594226007`*^9}, 
   3.9821473199462757`*^9, 3.982147986541789*^9, 3.982198270274953*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[263]=",ExpressionUUID->"9dbf96c7-102f-4351-8cb2-32e3977d89e3"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "Translate", " ", "the", " ", "above", " ", "condition", " ", "into", " ", 
    "a", " ", "logOddsOffset"}], "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{"logOddsOffset", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"N", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Log", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"myP", "+", "myDelta"}], ")"}], "/", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"1", "-", "myP", "-", "myDelta"}], ")"}]}], "]"}], "-", 
     RowBox[{"Log", "[", 
      RowBox[{"myP", "/", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"1", "-", "myP"}], ")"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982147061514414*^9, 3.982147072266439*^9}, {
  3.982147142808474*^9, 3.982147190625877*^9}, {3.9821472265793543`*^9, 
  3.982147237052775*^9}, {3.9821473334421473`*^9, 3.982147337108317*^9}},
 CellLabel->
